 4. 🐶 1 fun thing: Girl Scout pup treats 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Girl Scouts of the USA/AP Girl Scouts of the USA is rolling out its first cookies for dogs.

 The blueberry-muffin-flavored cookies, called Patch Pals, will be sold online starting in January. 🍪 Also coming this January: Sparkables, the group's first allergy-friendly cookie. 

 The crunchy oatmeal cookie has chocolate chips and colored sprinkles. Read the announcement . 

 
 
